WHY AGPL v3?

This license ensures that anyone who modifies this software and runs it
as a network service MUST open-source their modifications. This prevents
competitors from taking this code, improving it, and running a competing
service without contributing their changes back.

For personal use, evaluation, and hackathon judging: you are free to
read, run, and test this software under the terms of AGPL v3.
